  "trigger": "Alive",
  "summary": "<p>生きているかの判定結果が返ってきます。</p>",
  "syntax": [
    "Alive"
  ],
  "description": "生きているかの判定結果が返ってきます。<br>プレイヤーが生きていれば1を、死んでいれば0を返します。<br>死亡した場合の処理や死んでいる時に処理したくない・してはいけないステートのトリガーに記載されることが多いです。",
  "code_sample": [
    {
      "title": "死亡ステートへの処理",
      "description": "コモンステートの<code>[StateDef 0]</code>に記載されている処理",
      "code": [
        "[State ]",
        "Type = ChangeState",
        "Trigger1 = !Alive",
        "value = 5050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "死亡している場合に処理しないステートに記述",
      "code": [
        ";==============================================================================",
        "; 近くの敵を確認",
        ";==============================================================================",
        "",
        "[State -2]",
        "Type = VarSet",
        "Trigger1 = NumEnemy > 1",
        "Trigger1 = !Enemy(1),IsHelper",
        "var(20) = (!Enemy,Alive || (EnemyNear,Alive && EnemyNear,ID != Enemy,ID))",
        "",
        "",
        ";==============================================================================",
        "; 自動ライフ回復",
        ";==============================================================================",
        "",
        "[State -2]",
        "Type = LifeAdd",
        "TriggerAll = MoveType != H",
        "TriggerAll = Alive",
        "TriggerAll = RoundState = 2",
        "TriggerAll = Life < LifeMax*0.2",
        "Trigger1 = Ceil(GameTime%4) = 1",
        "value = 1",
        "Absolute = 1",
        "IgnoreHitPause = 1",
        "",
        "",
        ";==============================================================================",
        "; ゴールドカラーの自動ゲージ回復",
        ";==============================================================================",
        "",
        "[State -2]",
        "Type = PowerAdd",
        "TriggerAll = PalNo = 12",
        "TriggerAll = Alive",
        "Trigger1 = RoundState = 2",
        "value = 2",
        "Absolute = 1",
        "IgnoreHitPause = 1",
        "",
        "",
        ";==============================================================================",
        "; ダメージを受けたときのボイス処理",
        ";==============================================================================",
        "",
        "[State -2]",
        "Type = PlaySnd",
        "TriggerAll = Alive",
        "TriggerAll = Time = 1",
        "Trigger1 = StateNo = 5000 || StateNo = 5010 || StateNo = 5020 || StateNo = 5070",
        "Trigger1 = GetHitVar(AnimType) = 0",
        "Trigger1 = Random <= 600",
        "value = 4,0",
        "Channel = 0"
      ],
      "visibility": "internal"
    },
